+## Bulk import
+
+`importTasks(list, text)` adds tasks from text with one task per line, as `title;priority;tags`: the priority
+may be empty for a normal one, and tags are separated by spaces (`Renew the insurance;high;admin money`).
+Blank lines are skipped. It returns `{ imported, rejected }`: `imported` counts the tasks added, and
+`rejected` lists each line that could not be added as `{ line, reason }`, `line` counting from 1. A rejected
+line (invalid input, a duplicate title, too many fields) does not stop the others.
